flowchart TD
    A[User Reports Suspicious Email] --> B[Preserve Original Email]
    B --> C[Analyse Email Headers]
    C --> D[Check From, Return-Path and Reply-To]
    D --> E[Validate SPF, DKIM and DMARC]
    E --> F[Extract URLs, Domains, IPs and Attachments]
    F --> G[Threat Intelligence Enrichment]
    G --> H[Sandbox Analysis]
    H --> I[Risk Classification]
    I --> J[Containment and Blocking]
    J --> K[Search for Similar Emails]
    K --> L[Document Findings]
    L --> M[Recommend Preventive Controls]
